    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E4DCC8;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(22,51,44,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#16332C;margin:0 0 8px;">Free Written Estimates</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">We crawl under the home, measure every pier, and hand you a written price before any work starts. No surprises when the job's done.</p>
